    "detailed_description": "<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1717070/extras/2a34adffbc28370f254c97183aa8a840.avif?t=1744556802\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Remember that you can replay the demo with a funny language translation, just start in &quot;Advanced mode&quot; is the option right at the start of the game</h2></p><br><h1>Just Updated</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1717070/extras/37aa7cf903d5586e2e02b9bbb1c48a41.avif?t=1744556802\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You can hear the Soundtrack and Wishlist if you like it</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">(If there is any problem or something you recommend to change in the demo or page, you can use &quot;bug report&quot; in this store page)</h2></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1717070/extras/1a90d52f682dc9695f0af7cb1dce7fa0.avif?t=1744556802\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">- Uncover dystopian mysteries, power struggles, and societal turmoil.<br>- Improved narrative and character acting.<br>- More playable maps, and original music.<br>- Over 1,000 high-quality AI illustrations, even better than those in Chapter One!<br><br>- Enhanced turn-based JRPG with an improved engine, stunning visuals.<br>- You can play Chapter 2 first, treating Chapter 1 as a prequel. Wishlist both!<br>- Immersive Storyline: Intense battles intertwined with thought-provoking narrative. </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play the start of Chapter 1 free</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1717070/extras/1c19dd68376531b1350a78d460586f61.poster.avif?t=1744556802\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1717070/extras/1c19dd68376531b1350a78d460586f61.webm?t=1744556802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1717070/extras/1c19dd68376531b1350a78d460586f61.mp4?t=1744556802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">New Engine:<br><br>- Check Ayase\u2019s house screenshots with the new AI-powered pixel art.<br>- Higher-resolution graphics.<br>- Enhanced battle dynamics (upgraded from Chapter 1).<br><br>- Gamepad and Mouse support<br>- The battle system in the screenshots remains the same as in Chapter 1 due to ongoing development of the new system.</h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1717070/extras/fe60bfd106a336a7a525102690c52833.poster.avif?t=1744556802\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1717070/extras/fe60bfd106a336a7a525102690c52833.webm?t=1744556802\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1717070/extras/fe60bfd106a336a7a525102690c52833.mp4?t=1744556802\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1717070/extras/7c5031868739af068727bbc4f93ae3f0.avif?t=1744556802\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Two Worlds Collide: Virtual reality clashes with gritty real-life power factions.<br><br>New Characters: Meet Aika, Santiago, Ayase, and more. </h2><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1717070/extras/65328d836223da9716afab5420717766.avif?t=1744556802\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1717070/extras/31cc1f9137d616ce